ation</span></a>\n      <a href=\"/business-registration/section-8\" class=\"bizreg-card\"><div class=\"br-icon\">📜</div><span>Section 8 Company</span></a>\n      <div class=\"bizreg-more\"><a href=\"/business-registration\" class=\"btn btn-navy\">View All Options →</a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- BILLING SHOWCASE -->\n\n<section class=\"section billing-showcase\" id=\"billing\">\n  <div class=\"container billing-grid\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Powerful Billing & GST Invoice Management Software</h2>\n      <p>Create GST-compliant invoices, manage customers, products, reports and business finances from one secure platform.</p>\n      <ul class=\"feat-list\">\n        <li>GST Invoices</li><li>Credit & Debit Notes</li>\n        <li>Quotation & Proforma Invoice</li><li>Customer Management</li>\n        <li>Product Management</li><li>GST Reports</li>\n        <li>PDF & Excel Export</li><li>WhatsApp & Email Sharing</li>\n      </ul>\n      <div class=\"billing-actions\">\n        <a href=\"/billing-management\" class=\"btn btn-gold\">Explore Billing Software</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"billing-mock\">\n      <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1709880945165-d2208c6ad2ec?w=700&q=80\" alt=\"GST billing and invoice management software on laptop with calculator\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FAQ -->\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"container\" style=\"max-width:820px\">\n    <div class=\"section-head center\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center\">FAQ</p>\n      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><button class=\"faq-q\">How do I register a Private Limited Company? <span class=\"plus\">+</span></button><div class=\"faq-a\"><p>We handle end-to-end incorporation including DSC, name approval, MOA/AOA drafting and ROC filing, typically within 10–15 working days.</p></div></div>\n      <div class=\"faq-item\"><butt